    "body": "Fixes #10504\n\n## Root cause\n\nWhen re-encoding rollout samples for the policy-update stage, `GRPOTrainer` wraps the re-encode in `self._template_context(template)` without a `max_length` (swift/rlhf_trainers/grpo_trainer.py:723 and :2085 before this change). `_template_context` then sets `template.max_length = None`, so `encode_sample` re-encodes the raw messages with truncation fully disabled. As a result the training-side sequences can far exceed `max_length + max_completion_length` (in the repro: 1342 tokens vs. the 640 bound), and OOM occurs no matter how small `max_length` is.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Add `GRPOTrainer._train_encode_max_length(template)` returning `template.max_length + self.max_completion_length` (swift/rlhf_trainers/grpo_trainer.py:706).\n- Pass that bound via `self._template_context(template, max_length=...)` at both training-side re-encode sites (policy-update `_prepare_batch_inputs` path and `_generate_and_split`-adjacent chunk re-encode), so truncation matches rollout: with `truncation_strategy='left'`, the completion tokens are kept as the suffix and the prompt head is truncated — identical to rollout-side truncation.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Red: `timeout 240 /tmp/mswvenv/bin/python /tmp/msw_fix_repro.py` against PyPI `ms-swift 4.7.0.dev0` (no fix) → `buggy train-side total: 1342 | exceeds bound: True`, and `AttributeError: type object 'GRPOTrainer' has no attribute '_train_encode_max_length'`.\n- Green: same command with `PYTHONPATH=<clone>` → `rollout=128 ≤ 128`; `fixed train-side total: 640 | bound = 640`; assertion that the 512-token completion is a suffix passes; assertion that the train-side prompt tail equals the rollout left-truncation prefix passes.\n- Module checks: `PYTHONPATH=. /tmp/mswvenv/bin/python -c \"from swift.rlhf_trainers.grpo_trainer import GRPOTrainer\"` → `IMPORT_OK` (attribute present); `python -m py_compile swift/rlhf_trainers/grpo_trainer.py` → `COMPILE_OK`.\n- Repo GPU tests (`tests/train/test_grpo.py` etc.) require CUDA; this machine has no GPU, so they were **not** run.\n\n## AI disclosure\n\nThis fix was produced with the assistance of an AI coding agent.\n\n已发认领评论（含 AI 披露）：https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/issues/10504#issuecomment-6622339546；timeline 查重本账号无更早 PR/认领。\n",
